        "node_id": "n_8_cdfc77",
        "thought_text": "Use the fact that n = m^2 - k^2 can be rewritten as n = (m+k)(m-k). Iterate over possible factors of n and solve for m and k.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "6224721041004170327",
